DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42728::$$$message_0349_0000_0000$$$::"Sakura... If Rider's with you dressed like that, then..."::
42729::$$$message_0349_0000_0001$$$::"The same goes for you, Senpai, if Saber is with you."::
42730::$$$message_0349_0000_0002$$$::"I see. We understand our mutual situations well."::
42731::$$$message_0349_0000_0003$$$::"It appears so. This time, it won't be a duel to the death.[lr]::
42732::$$$message_0349_0000_0004$$$::We can fight to a clear outcome, with no reservations."::
42733::$$$message_0349_0000_0005$$$::"No, Sakura... Do we have to fight?"::
42734::$$$message_0349_0000_0006$$$::"N-no, I'd rather not fight you, Senpai[line len=2]"::
42735::$$$message_0349_0000_0007$$$::"Sakura. Surely you don't intend to yield to them?"::
42736::$$$message_0349_0000_0008$$$::"But I can't fight Senpai..."::
42737::$$$message_0349_0000_0009$$$::"Sakura. I will obey your decisions. But I want you to hear me out, first."::
42738::$$$message_0349_0000_0010$$$::"O-[hfchance layer=0]okay. What is it, Rider?"::
42739::$$$message_0349_0000_0011$$$::"Hypothetically speaking, if you were to yield the way, then Shirou and Saber would go to the onsen together."::
42740::$$$message_0349_0000_0012$$$::"..."::
42741::$$$message_0349_0000_0013$$$::"Saber is likely to defeat most foes, and Shirou will regard her highly for it. They'll be alone in a bathhouse together... Do you see where I'm going with this?"::
42742::$$$message_0349_0000_0014$$$::"We're winning this, Rider."[rf]::
42743::$$$message_0349_0000_0015$$$::"Shirou, Sakura looks like she intends to fight."::
42744::$$$message_0349_0000_0016$$$::"S-[hfchance layer=1]Sakura!? I don't really want to fight you."::
42745::$$$message_0349_0000_0017$$$::"Hehe. I'm sorry, Senpai. If you have to blame something, then blame the fact that you're Saber's Master."::

